Monitor interface constants
---------------------------
crates/flowsdn-bpf-abi/src/lib.rs notify constants retain numeric interface
values from Cilium v1.20.1, commit 7d68cfb394, pkg/monitor/api/types.go and
api/v1/flow/flow.proto, Apache License 2.0. Decoder and correlation logic are
independent Rust implementations from the specifications.
